data-track-label="Stephen K. L. Chia" data-author-search="Chia, Stephen K. L.">Stephen K. L. Chia</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff7">7</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click_view_author" data-track-action="open author" data-track-index="10_11" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Torsten_O_-Nielsen-Aff1-Aff5" data-author-popup="auth-Torsten_O_-Nielsen-Aff1-Aff5" data-track-label="Torsten O. Nielsen" data-author-search="Nielsen, Torsten O.">Torsten O. Nielsen</a><span class="u-js-hide"> 
